# This file contains a list of files that will be excluded from Shopify CLI
# operations such as push, pull, dev, etc.
#
# Examples:
#
# Ignore a specific file:
#   templates/product.json
#
# Ignore templates with a wildcard pattern:
#   templates/*.json
#
# Ignore templates and sections with a regular expression:
#   /(templates|sections)/.*\.json/

# ── Protect all template JSONs ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Template JSON files store your hero slides and all other customizer content
# (section blocks, text, images, links). Excluding them ensures `theme push`
# never overwrites what you've saved in the Shopify customizer.
templates/*.json

# ── Protect global theme settings ────────────────────────────────────────────
# The customizer writes colours, fonts, and global settings to this file.
# Overwriting it resets your entire store appearance.
config/settings_data.json
